    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Logging Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Logging for the structured JSON log event. My focus is now on the implementation details within `write_structured_log.py`, ensuring a clear connection with the service provider in the code. I'm investigating the best approach to incorporate GCP's logging features directly.\n\n\n**Implementing Log Client**\n\nI'm now fully committed to integrating Google Cloud Logging, utilizing the `google-cloud-logging` library directly within `write_structured_log.py`. I've outlined the core steps: importing the client, instantiating it, crafting the JSON log entry as a dictionary, and then writing it, clearly defining the log name and payload.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789821251282,
          "start": 1789821249368
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a8e758001zN2DhD6HA9gIB2",
      "message_id": "msg_0b9a8e1b7001u5S4MWmANNBmKW",
